WEBVTT

00:04:29.389 --> 00:04:31.818
using tools like magnetic
resonance imaging

00:04:31.842 --> 00:04:33.318
to map brain pathways.

00:04:34.215 --> 00:04:36.490
Figuring out how your brain
responds to pain

00:04:36.514 --> 00:04:39.451
is the key to finding
the best treatment for you.

00:04:39.475 --> 00:04:41.557
That's true personalized medicine.